    narr:narration """The trajectory tracks [delivery milestones and velocity metrics](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789465193237_1) anchored by [the integration enabler](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789465193237_3) alongside [sprint output figures](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1789465193237_2), while the foundational scope is set by [the core product differentiator](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture) and framed through [technical driver benchmarks](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_AsyncWidgetDeliveryDrivers).""" ;
